{"ticker":"DIS","updated":"2026-11-13T23:13:24Z","profile":{"longName":"The Walt Disney Company","shortName":"Walt Disney Company (The)","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"United States","website":"https://thewaltdisneycompany.com","fullTimeEmployees":175560,"marketCap":205423935488,"trailingPE":24.529898,"forwardPE":15.878736,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0779068,"pegRatio":3.89,"targetMeanPrice":126.83281,"targetHighPrice":144.0,"targetLowPrice":86.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":32,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.068,"earningsGrowth":-0.483,"grossMargins":0.37595,"operatingMargins":0.15612,"profitMargins":0.086990006,"totalRevenue":98860998656,"beta":1.426,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":120.8,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":92.19,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.27},"summary":"The Walt Disney Company operates as an entertainment company in Americas, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. It operates in three segments: Entertainment, Sports, and Experiences. The company produces and distributes film and television content under the ABC Television Network, Disney, Freeform, FX, Fox, National Geographic, and Star brand television channels, as well as ABC television stations and A+E television networks; and produces original content under the Disney Branded Television, FX Productions, Lucasfilm, Marvel, National Geographic Studios, Pixar, Searchlight Pictures, Twentieth Century Studios, 20th Television, and Walt Disney Pictures banners. It also provides direct-to-consumer streaming services through Disney+, Disney+ Hotstar, and Hulu; sports-related video streaming content through ESPN, ESPN on ABC, ESPN+ DTC, and Star; sale/licensing of film and episodic content to television and video-on-demand services; theatrical, home entertainment, and music distribution services; DVD and Blu-ray discs, electronic home video licenses, and VOD rental services; staging and licensing of live entertainment events; and post-production services. In addition, the company operates theme parks and resorts, such as Walt Disney World Resort, Disneyland Resort, Disneyland Paris, Hong Kong Disneyland Resort, Shanghai Disney Resort, Disney Cruise Line, Disney Vacation Club, National Geogr","summary_zh":"華特迪士尼公司是一家娛樂公司，業務遍及美洲、歐洲和亞太地區。它分為三個部分：娛樂、體育和體驗。該公司製作和發行 ABC 電視網、迪士尼、Freeform、FX、福克斯、國家地理和 Star 品牌電影片道以及 ABC 電視台和 A+E 電視網的電影和電視內容；並在迪士尼品牌電視、FX Productions、盧卡斯影業、漫威、國家地理工作室、皮克斯、探照燈影業、二十世紀工作室、20th Television 和華特影業旗下原創內容燈影業。它還透過 Disney+、Disney+ Hotstar 和 Hulu 提供直接面向消費者的串流媒體服務；透過 ESPN、ESPN on ABC、ESPN+ DTC 和 Star 觀看體育相關的視訊串流內容；向電視和視訊點播服務出售/授權電影和劇集內容；戲劇、家庭娛樂和音樂發行服務； DVD 和藍光光碟、電子點播服務的家庭電影和劇集內容；此外，該公司還經營主題樂園和度假村，如華特迪士尼世界度假區、迪士尼樂園度假區、巴黎迪士尼樂園、香港迪士尼樂園度假區、上海迪士尼度假區、迪士尼郵輪公司、迪士尼度假俱樂部、國家地理","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"娛樂","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":116.11,"h":116.75,"l":115.0,"c":115.62,"v":7150900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":115.45,"h":115.85,"l":114.71,"c":115.23,"v":6844900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":115.24,"h":116.66,"l":115.22,"c":116.1,"v":7333900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":115.33,"h":115.78,"l":114.05,"c":114.86,"v":9460500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":114.6,"h":114.6,"l":111.93,"c":113.76,"v":23398400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":111.76,"h":113.63,"l":111.52,"c":112.56,"v":15479800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":112.72,"h":113.62,"l":111.6,"c":112.25,"v":13145000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":112.41,"h":114.15,"l":112.2,"c":113.43,"v":8755200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":112.71,"h":114.05,"l":112.65,"c":112.99,"v":6365500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":113.13,"h":113.57,"l":112.76,"c":113.47,"v":6145700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":113.47,"h":115.01,"l":113.33,"c":114.78,"v":9304100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":114.53,"h":114.88,"l":113.34,"c":114.5,"v":9303700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":114.08,"h":116.06,"l":112.79,"c":112.95,"v":9736300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":112.98,"h":113.17,"l":110.78,"c":112.14,"v":8695100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":112.04,"h":113.57,"l":111.56,"c":112.47,"v":7148400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":112.69,"h":113.11,"l":111.45,"c":112.75,"v":6141200},{"t":"